{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/7a697c0156d1625b1a4c03c01c1f54b0.poster.avif?t=1756689471\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/extras/7a697c0156d1625b1a4c03c01c1f54b0.webm?t=1756689471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PomoTrain: Rabbit Town</strong> is an <strong>idle game with a Pomodoro timer</strong>, set in a whimsical world of cute trains and a rabbit town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your preset Pomodoro session begins, the train departs; when it ends, the train arrives. Passengers hop on during the ride, and you earn coins as time passes. Use your earnings to purchase simple upgrades and adorable skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed like a cozy desktop accessory, it keeps you company while you work and helps make focus and breaks more enjoyable. While the core Pomodoro feature is already the heart of the game, more functions are in development to enrich your experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969190?t=1756689471","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969190?t=1756689471","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/10b9411edad6e767c88159ee53dc7d58d3be900c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756689471","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969190/10b9411edad6e767c88159ee53dc7d58d3be900c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756689471","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"de